  <sysml:Block xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1620204390621_784441_98818" xmi:uuid="f642bef0-b235-013c-7b62-089a2f3f1c8a">
    <base_Class xmi:idref="_18_4_1_91401df_1620204390621_703870_98817"/>
  </sysml:Block>
  <sysml:Block xmi:id="_18_4_1_af4021f_1649233046778_209763_148288" xmi:uuid="f642c880-b235-013c-7b62-089a2f3f1c8a">
    <base_Class xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1649233046776_937737_148287"/>
  </sysml:Block>
  <uml:Package xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1619506231326_659448_91901" xmi:uuid="59796035-9e5c-4994-b168-3c7ab1e2b767" xmi:type="uml:Package">
    <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1620291036522_273360_94190" xmi:uuid="837a8738-5c1a-40d3-ab4f-a34a048c9030" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
      <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_91401df_1619506231326_659448_91901"/>
      <body>This capability enables the representation of annotated model presentation, consisting of: &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;annotated model presentation;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;annotation callout;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;annotation placeholder with leader line;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;camera view 3D;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;appearance assignment;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;curve appearance;&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;text appearance.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; The Figure &lt;caption&gt;Simplified overview of the AP242 Annotated Model presentation&lt;/caption&gt; provides an overview of the capability. &lt;figuresysml&gt;&lt;id&gt;_18_4_1_91401df_1620221920273_268853_90884&lt;/id&gt;Simplified overview of the AP242 Annotated Model presentation&lt;/figuresysml&gt; Unless otherwise specified, an AnnotatedModelPresentation shall be a presentation of model with annotation according to ISO 16792. A Callout is a collection of presentation specific annotation elements depicting information or requirements about the product itself. An AnnotationPlaceholderOccurrence provides enough information about the position, orientation and leader lines of an annotation so that a target system with annotation authoring capability can re-create the presentation. A leader line only consist of a list of points with an associated optional terminator symbol.</body>
    </ownedComment>
    <name>AnnotatedModelPresentation</name>
    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1619507105520_772248_94448" xmi:uuid="00298749-7b3e-4098-8aac-76a698700abe" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1619509974251_291058_94744" xmi:uuid="5eabb645-ff65-4d56-8ee7-37ae22880c6f" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_91401df_1619507105520_772248_94448"/>
        <body>An AnnotationPlaceholderOccurrence is a type of RepresentationItem that provides enough information about the position and orientation of a PMI annotation so that a target system with PMI authoring capability can re-create the presentation based on the Representation data given in the file. An annotation occurrence aggregates one or more leader lines to provide data necessary to render needed leader lines. &lt;note&gt;This avoids requiring the user of the target system to manually position each PMI element.&lt;/note&gt; &lt;example&gt;An AnnotationPlaceholderOccurrence specifies two LeaderLines, one of which is an AnnotationToModelLeaderLine, illustrated in the Figure &lt;caption&gt;A leader line with forward arrowhead that starts at annotation and ends at model&lt;/caption&gt;, and the other of which is an AuxiliaryLeaderLine, illustrated in the Figure &lt;caption&gt;An AuxiliaryLeaderLine with forward arrowhead that starts at a random location and ends at model&lt;/caption&gt;, to provide location data for a placeholder for presentation of a geometric tolerance. The point list for the Figure &lt;caption&gt;A leader line with forward arrowhead that starts at annotation and ends at model&lt;/caption&gt; is (A1, A2, A3) while that for Figure &lt;caption&gt;An AuxiliaryLeaderLine with forward arrowhead that starts at a random location and ends at model&lt;/caption&gt; is (B1, B2, B3).&lt;/example&gt; &lt;figure&gt;&lt;name&gt;annotation_placeholder_occurrence_with_leader_line_1.gif&lt;/name&gt;A leader line with forward arrowhead that starts at annotation and ends at model&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;figure&gt;&lt;name&gt;annotation_placeholder_occurrence_with_leader_line_2.gif&lt;/name&gt;An AuxiliaryLeaderLine with forward arrowhead that starts at a random location and ends at model&lt;/figure&gt; &lt;table&gt; &lt;name&gt;Attribute Mapping&lt;/name&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;th&gt;Name&lt;/th&gt; &lt;th&gt;TYPE&lt;/th&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;angular dimension&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;AngularLocation&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;angularity&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;AngularityTolerance&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;circular runout&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;CircularRunoutTolerance&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;circularity&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;RoundnessTolerance&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;coaxiality&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;CoaxialityTolerance&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;concentricity&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;ConcentricityTolerance&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;curve dimension&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;CurvedSize&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;cylindricity&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;CylindricityTolerance&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;datum&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;Datum&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;datum target&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;DatumTarget&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;diameter dimension&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;DiameterSize&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;flatness&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;FlatnessTolerance&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;general dimension&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;DimensionalSize&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;general note&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;PropertyValueAssignment&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;general tolerance&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;DimensionalSize&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;label&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;PropertyValueAssignment&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;linear dimension&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;LinearDistance&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;ordinate dimension&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;DimensionalSize&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;note &lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;PropertyValueAssignment&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;parallelism &lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;ParallelismTolerance&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;perpendicularity&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;PerpendicularityTolerance&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;position &lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;PositionTolerance&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;profile of line&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;LineProfileTolerance&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;profile of surface&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;SurfaceProfileTolerance&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;radial dimension&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;RadialSize&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;roundness &lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;RoundnessTolerance&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;straightness &lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;StraightnessTolerance&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;symmetry &lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;SymmetryTolerance&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;total runout &lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;TotalRunoutTolerance&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;/table&gt; </body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>AnnotationPlaceholderOccurrence</name>
      <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_4_1_af4021f_1663143822444_4768_147689" xmi:uuid="9a454b22-0d7e-474e-81de-fb499e2404ef" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1663406524496_339904_162077" xmi:uuid="ff1ae7b1-53c8-4c3c-b3f8-ba685cddd1a1" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1663143822444_4768_147689"/>
          <body>The content of an AnnotationPlaceholderOccurrence shall be one axis placement, one or more point subtype instance, zero or one planar box, zero or one text.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>IP1</name>
        <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_91401df_1619507105520_772248_94448"/>
        <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_af4021f_1663143822446_611547_147690" xmi:uuid="b458f37f-007f-4743-bdfa-4afdbf9858e4" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
          <body>The content of an AnnotationPlaceholderOccurrence shall be one axis placement, one or more point subtype instance, zero or one planar box, zero or one text.</body>
          <language>English</language>
        </specification>
      </ownedRule>
      <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_4_1_af4021f_1663143852987_116254_147691" xmi:uuid="bf456663-9922-4035-ab64-ef36ce4be813" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_65b021e_1663406511078_402568_162074" xmi:uuid="b686c140-f27d-454b-952f-4e2605d40010" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_af4021f_1663143852987_116254_147691"/>
          <body>If the role is for geometric product specification purposes, the name of the GeometricPlaceholderSet shall be correlated with the type specified by the Definition attribute of the AnnotatedModelItemAssociation according to the table above.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>IP2</name>
        <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_91401df_1619507105520_772248_94448"/>
        <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_af4021f_1663143852987_727566_147692" xmi:uuid="2817cce8-c800-4edd-a5e6-7ce42fc4ad17" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
          <body>If the role is for geometric product specification purposes the name of the RepresentationItem supertype of the GeometricPlaceholderSet specified by the attribute element shall be correlated with the type specified by the IdentifiedItem attribute of that AnnotatedModelPresentation according to the table above.</body>
          <language>English</language>
        </specification>
      </ownedRule>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1619508407024_821768_94557" xmi:uuid="27944693-e4eb-4ad9-9c69-75120c299079" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
