      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1621589753371_18456_92532" xmi:uuid="66adfd7b-078f-49ca-bc5f-bc4a7af8799f" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_91401df_1620057050641_11898_94186"/>
        <body>A PreDefinedColour is a type of Colour which is defined by name as defined in the table below. &lt;table&gt; &lt;name&gt;Red, green and blue colour components&lt;/name&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;Colour name&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;Red&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;Green&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;Blue&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;black&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;0.0&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;0.0&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;0.0&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;red&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;1.0&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;0.0&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;0.0&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;green&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;0.0&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;1.0&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;0.0&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;blue&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;0.0&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;0.0&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;1.0&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;yellow&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;1.0&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;1.0&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;0.0&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;magenta&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;1.0&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;0.0&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;1.0&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;cyan&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;0.0&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;1.0&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;1.0&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;tr&gt; &lt;td&gt;white&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;1.0&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;1.0&lt;/td&gt; &lt;td&gt;1.0&lt;/td&gt; &lt;/tr&gt; &lt;/table&gt;</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>PreDefinedColour</name>
      <ownedRule xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1717142308551_525782_132725" xmi:uuid="399c95ce-8c98-4166-b78f-487e08767842" xmi:type="uml:Constraint">
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1717142330151_609347_132727" xmi:uuid="45c1816e-8dc9-42c0-a4ae-7b2bb327ecec" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_91401df_1717142308551_525782_132725"/>
          <body>the Name of the PreDefinedColour shall be 'red', 'green', 'blue', 'yellow', 'magenta', 'cyan', 'black', or 'white'.</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1717144965197_666587_132751" xmi:uuid="fc7ea0fc-3366-44cd-a5df-cfe5ecf84c42" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
          <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1717144972956_886474_132752" xmi:uuid="bc177f6e-03f1-47fa-8264-043545157cb1" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
            <body>&lt;sch:rule context="//*[ @uid and substring-after(@xsi:type,':')='PreDefinedColour']/Name"&gt; &lt;sch:let name="uid" value="../@uid" /&gt; &lt;sch:assert test="CharacterString ='red' or CharacterString ='green' or CharacterString ='blue' or CharacterString ='yellow' or CharacterString ='magenta' or CharacterString ='cyan' or CharacterString ='black' or CharacterString ='white'"&gt; (PreDefinedColour.WR1: &lt;sch:value-of select="$uid" /&gt;)The Name of the PreDefinedColour shall be 'red', 'green', 'blue', 'yellow', 'magenta', 'cyan', 'black', or 'white'.&lt;/sch:assert&gt; &lt;/sch:rule&gt;</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <body>Schematron</body>
        </ownedComment>
        <name>WR1</name>
        <constrainedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_91401df_1620057050641_11898_94186"/>
        <specification xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1717142308551_955941_132726" xmi:uuid="e2fdbac9-a84f-4622-b431-a1f60f24f0d3" xmi:type="uml:OpaqueExpression">
          <body>self.Name.oclAsType(Application_protocols::AP242::Domain_model::CommonResources::CharacterStringProxy).value = 'red' or self.Name.oclAsType(Application_protocols::AP242::Domain_model::CommonResources::CharacterStringProxy).value= 'green' or self.Name.oclAsType(Application_protocols::AP242::Domain_model::CommonResources::CharacterStringProxy).value= 'blue' or self.Name.oclAsType(Application_protocols::AP242::Domain_model::CommonResources::CharacterStringProxy).value= 'yellow' or self.Name.oclAsType(Application_protocols::AP242::Domain_model::CommonResources::CharacterStringProxy).value= 'magenta' or self.Name.oclAsType(Application_protocols::AP242::Domain_model::CommonResources::CharacterStringProxy).value= 'cyan' or self.Name.oclAsType(Application_protocols::AP242::Domain_model::CommonResources::CharacterStringProxy).value= 'black' or self.Name.oclAsType(Application_protocols::AP242::Domain_model::CommonResources::CharacterStringProxy).value= 'white'</body>
          <language>OCL2.0</language>
        </specification>
      </ownedRule>
      <generalization xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1620057089225_163653_94231" xmi:uuid="45c35080-74f4-4be9-8a9a-e03afc28c151" xmi:type="uml:Generalization">
        <general xmi:idref="_18_4_1_91401df_1620054885001_949491_93983"/>
      </generalization>
    </packagedElement>
    <packagedElement xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1619785583948_632237_101333" xmi:uuid="3bb190c4-1006-46b7-bfc4-0ea4ccdff22e" xmi:type="uml:Class">
      <ownedComment xmi:id="_18_4_1_91401df_1621589918970_908761_92537" xmi:uuid="1a8b1ebe-738a-4ad3-bf53-e4a4225eff72" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
        <annotatedElement xmi:idref="_18_4_1_91401df_1619785583948_632237_101333"/>
        <body>A StyledModelReplication is a type of RepresentationItem that replicates a StyledModel in another StyledModel that includes it with a transformation.</body>
      </ownedComment>
      <name>StyledModelReplication</name>
